V1.0.0 - Release 
- Addition of Java Spring to the application

upcoming Release
- Addition of SQL to the project to make the data permanent
V2.0.0 - Skipping this Release as V3.0.0 added everything

V3.0.0 - Release

- Added Postgres support for storing tickets, user, operations data
- Added new IEE engine support for actively learning the resolution and tickets
- Added support for llm agents for classifying and providing the resolution to the engineer
- IEE engine has almost unlimited memory context as it's constantly learns and matures for the resolution tips
    stored constantly on the table
- Now operations has more visibility and more data control
- Added JWT for authentication supporting new Login Page
- Dashboard data update is now fully interactive and user will have large control on the data

